# The Express + ws backend in api/ deploys SEPARATELY (see api/Dockerfile,
# api/fly.toml) and must never be uploaded to Vercel. Vercel's zero-config
# treats files under a top-level api/ directory as Serverless Functions (one per
# .ts), which both deploys the wrong thing and blows past the Hobby plan's
# 12-function limit. The SvelteKit frontend build does not reference api/ at all.
api
